{"type":"message","id":"8274cd99","parentId":"7af30c1a","timestamp":"2026-06-03T03:33:26.688Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error code 1101 consistently. The GET /history endpoints work fine. This might be a Cloudflare Workers error code (1101 is \"Worker exceeded resource limits\").\n\nLet me try a simpler approach - maybe the platform is rate-limiting or has a resource issue. The heartbeat messages are very long and might be hitting some limit. Let me try a minimal message to see if it gets through.\n\nActually, error 1101 from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker threw an exception\" or \"Uncaught exception\". This could mean the worker itself is crashing when processing the send endpoint. Since GET works but POST doesn't, there's likely a bug in the worker's message handling code.\n\n\nI'll try sending a minimal message to test if length is the issue.","thinkingSignature":"90bed326ee53da5afc543768070bbe170700ecad0bf55b8e9be312daf191512d"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_2egg89eoca2k_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\": \"arbitration\", \"content\": \"03:30 UTC heartbeat OK\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":845,"output":256,"cacheRead":21760,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22861,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780457602780,"responseId":"066ed3838209a320c859c9fb830607fa"}}
